msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're the man from before. I was watching you work your\r\n"
"magic! It looks like you're pretty well acquainted with that\r\n"
"beautiful brunette."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "...I guess so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"However, it seems like a language barrier is preventing you\r\n"
"two from becoming as close as you could be..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"...Which is why I'll offer you our Intermediate Handbook for\r\n"
"the low, low price of only 20,000 yen! Only in Okinawa!\r\n"
"How's that for a local specialty!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"The intermediate handbook focuses more on direct\r\n"
"communication between close friends and even more intimate\r\n"
"relationships. I'm sure you've just gotta have it, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"No thanks. I'm not really interested in learning any more\r\n"
"English."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? After all the trouble you went through to get to know her... "
"Wouldn't that be a waste?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Either way, this discounted price is only available for a\r\n"
"a limited time, so come find me if you change your mind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "20,000 yen... All right, then, I'll take it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Very well. Then here's your Intermediate Handbook."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>20,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "You got an <Color:8>Intermediate English Textbook<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "(Okay. This section is about \"Conversing with a Lover.\")"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Ｉ　ｄｏｎ'ｔ　ｗａｎｔ　ｔｏ　ｇｏ　ｈｏｍｅ\r\n"
" ｔｏｎｉｇｈｔ．"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Ｉ　ｄｏｎ'ｔ　ｄｅｓｅｒｖｅ　ｙｏｕｒ　ｌｏｖｅ．"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "(These are way too cheesy...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"You'll be a real player if you can chat her up in English,\r\n"
"you know. After all, there are some things you can only say\r\n"
"in English that can show her how stylish and cultured you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"Our English handbooks only teach you the stuff you need to\r\n"
"know, nothing more, nothing less. And the more effort you\r\n"
"put into it, the more you'll get out of it, guaranteed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"By the way, I hear a lot of foreigners hang out at a bar in\r\n"
"Hatsumachi called Aqua Sky. Well, as they say in English...\r\n"
"Ｈａｖｅ　ａ　ｎｉｃｅ　ｄａｙ！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Actually, I think I'm a little short on cash. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's okay. The book will be on sale all through this\r\n"
"week, so you can always come back and find me when you have\r\n"
"a little more to spend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Oh, you're the man from before. Have you changed your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid ""
"Our Intermediate Handbook is just 20,000 yen, but only for\r\n"
"a limited time. Ready to beef up your knowledge?"
msgstr ""

